drone-duels' changes to Betaflight's SITL (scripts/setup.sh applies them; drone_duels.firmware.betaflight).

- Its ports are arguments: --simport (the simulator's four UDP ports, from 9001) and --tcpbaseport
  (UARTn on TCP base + n, from 5760). Its own are ArduPilot's (5760, 9002), and every slot needs
  its own (drone_duels.ports).
- It listens on 127.0.0.1 only: its RC port would take sticks from the network.
- The OSD, sent over MSP DisplayPort as to a DJI air unit: stock SITL builds without one.
- State arriving before its virtual sensors exist is dropped: it crashed SITL as it booted.

